('ix','If f(x,y)=3xe^y+x³y², then fᵧ is:',['3xe^y+2x³y','3x^y e+2y3x² [source label (l)]','3xe^y−2x³y','3x²y²+3e^y'],['For fᵧ hold x constant.','The derivative of 3xe^y is 3xe^y.','The derivative of x³y² is 2x³y.','Add to obtain fᵧ=3xe^y+2x³y.','Select (a). The malformed second printed expression is retained as printed rather than silently repaired.','The fourth option resembles a different derivative and is not the y partial.'],'(a) 3xe^y+2x³y.')
